{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "Agent recipes. Design: DESIGN.md §5.1–5.2. Commands & endpoints are DESIGN-BASELINE and MUST be re-verified per agent before M2 release (design §13). Flip `verified` to true only after manual E2E pass.",
    "updatedAt": "2026-01-01",
